    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="1330f890-d4eb-51b8-a8f2-fca2e54d28b2" activityNameId="2180a55e-a7f4-5951-a778-172a555c6909" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Laminated timber element, transversally prestressed, for outdoor use, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Laminated timber element, transversally prestressed, for outdoor use, at plant
Covers screwed-laminated timber element, transversally prestressed, for outdoor use, mainly for bridges. The multi-output process "laminated timber element, outdoor use, production" delivers the three coproducts "laminated timber element, transversally prestressed, for outdoor use, at plant", "industrial residue wood, LTE production, softwood, u=20%, at plant" and "industrial residue wood, LTE production, hardwood, u=20%, at plant". Allocation is based on the over-all proceeds of the process.;
UUID: a769462c-cfa1-3e08-992b-c8d98247fe40
Includes the inputs to the production processes and transports of those inputs. No process emission data are available.
Location: Data for Germany used for central Europe
Technology: Medium enterprise technology (1995)
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that the technology is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a769462c-cfa1-3e08-992b-c8d98247fe40.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
